1 does bodyslam!":32,"Shock":33,"Inflicts Thunder-type damage and Paralysis state.":34,"Slime":35,"Covers an enemy in slime and lowers their Agility.":36,"%1 shoots out slime!":37,"Venom":38,"Sprays an enemy with venom and inflicts Poison state.":39,"%1 uses %2!":40,"Shout":41,"Rouses the user’s fighting spirit and fortifies\ntheir abilities.":42,"%1 rouses their fighting spirit!":43,"Bizarre Dance":44,"Absorbs MP from an enemy.":45,"%1 dances bizarrely!":46,"Petrify":47,"Glares at an enemy and paralyzes them.":48,"Eye Poke":49,"Blinds an enemy.":50,"Sandstorm":51,"Blinds all enemies.":52,"Flash":53,"Toxic Fog":54,"Poisons all enemies.":55,"Lullaby":56,"Puts all enemies to sleep.":57,"%1 sings a Lullaby!":58,"Alluring Melody":59,"Charms all enemies.":60,"%1 sings an Alluring Melody!":61,"Song of Silence":62,"Seals all enemies’ magic.":63,"%1 sings a Song of Silence!":64,"Sonic Wave":65,"Confuses all enemies.":66,"Stone Throw":67,"Inflicts Earth-type damage on all enemies.":68,"Dust Devil":69,"Inflicts Wind-type damage on all enemies.":70,"Fire Breath":71,"Inflicts Fire-type damage on all enemies.":72,"Ice Breath":73,"Inflicts Ice-type damage on all enemies.":74,"Earthquake":75,"%1 causes an Earthquake!":76,"Tsunami":77,"Inflicts Water-type damage on all enemies.":78,"%1 causes a Tsunami!":79,"Scratch":80,"Inflicts damage on an enemy.":81,"-----Basic Magic":82,"Heal I":83,"Restores an ally’s HP.":84,"%1 casts %2!":85,"Heal II":86,"Heal III":87,"Recover I":88,"Restores all allies’ HP.":89,"Recover II":90,"Recover III":91,"Cure I":92,"Cures an ally’s Poison, Paralysis, or Sleep state.":93,"Cure II":94,"Cures an ally’s status ailments other than Dead.":95,"Cure III":96,"Cures all allies’ status ailments other than Dead.":97,"Raise I":98,"Raises an ally from the dead.":99,"Raise II":100,"Raises an ally from the dead and greatly restores\ntheir HP.":101,"Poison":102,"Blind":103,"Confuse":104,"Silence":105,"Sleep":106,"Paralyze":107,"Paralyzes all enemies.":108,"Weapon Bless":109,"Increases an ally’s Attack.\nUsable up to 2 times in a row.":110,"Weapon Curse":111,"Decreases all enemies’ Attack.\nUsable up to 2 times in a row.":112,"Armor Bless":113,"Increases an ally’s Defense.\nUsable up to 2 times in a row.":114,"Armor Curse":115,"Decreases all enemies’ Defense.\nUsable up to 2 times in a row.":116,"Spirit Bless":117,"Increases an ally’s M.Attack.\nUsable up to 2 times in a row.":118,"Spirit Curse":119,"Decreases all enemies’ M.Attack.\nUsable up to 2 times in a row.":120,"Divine Bless":121,"Increases an ally’s M.Defense.\nUsable up to 2 times in a row.":122,"Divine Curse":123,"Decreases all enemies’ M.Defense.\nUsable up to 2 times in a row.":124,"Quicken Movement":125,"Increases an ally’s Agility.\nUsable up to 2 times in a row.":126,"Slow Movement":127,"Decreases all enemies’ Agility.\nUsable up to 2 times in a row.":128,"Life Drain":129,"Mana Drain":130,"Fire I":131,"Inflicts Fire-type damage on an enemy.":132,"Fire II":133,"Fire III":134,"Flame I":135,"Flame II":136,"Flame III":137,"Ice I":138,"Inflicts Ice-type damage on an enemy.":139,"Ice II":140,"Ice III":141,"Blizzard I":142,"Blizzard II":143,"Blizzard III":144,"Thunder I":145,"Inflicts Thunder-type damage on an enemy.":146,"Thunder II":147,"Thunder III":148,"Spark I":149,"Inflicts Thunder-type damage on all enemies.":150,"Spark II":151,"Spark III":152,"Water I":153,"Inflicts Water-type damage on an enemy.":154,"Water II":155,"Wave I":156,"Wave II":157,"Stone I":158,"Inflicts Earth-type damage on an enemy.":159,"Stone II":160,"Quake I":161,"Quake II":162,"Wind I":163,"Inflicts Wind-type damage on an enemy.":164,"Wind II":165,"Tornado I":166,"Tornado II":167,"Saint I":168,"Inflicts Light-type damage on an enemy.":169,"Saint II":170,"Starlight I":171,"Inflicts Light-type damage on all enemies.":172,"Starlight II":173,"Shade I":174,"Inflicts Darkness-type damage on an enemy.":175,"Shade II":176,"Darkness I":177,"Inflicts Darkness-type damage on all enemies.":178,"Darkness II